{"id":"wb-7-1500","name":"水浴寺石窟","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"水浴寺石窟","text":"水浴寺石窟，位于中国河北省邯郸市邯郸市峰峰矿区，石刻时间为南北朝至明代时期，隔凤凰台和天宫峰与北响堂寺东西相峙，因规模比南、北响堂寺小，又叫小响堂。1982年被评为河北省重点文物保护单位。2013年5月，被国务院公布为第七批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B0%B4%E6%B5%B4%E5%AF%BA%E7%9F%B3%E7%AA%9F","revisionId":94376303,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94376303","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/c23c2d410ecbe15af99a7a02.jpg","title":"20260817_Shuiyu_Temple_Grottoes_02.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20260817_Shuiyu_Temple_Grottoes_02.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/35/20260817_Shuiyu_Temple_Grottoes_02.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​全国重点文物保护单位 河北峰峰 水浴寺石窟","width":320,"height":213}}